"Jin was born in another world he calls 'Before', dying young in small-town Canada."
"In his past life Jin ran a wastewater plant; that know-how now shapes his village planning."
"Jin loved anime, manga and cheap translated xianxia tales in his life Before."
"Jin has accepted his mortality; he seeks to make his own heaven, not to ascend."
"Once, in a hug, Jin briefly seemed someone else, called 'father' by a voice named Bu."
"On the journey, Jin and Meiling will go incognito as 'Rou' and 'Lin Liling'."
"Later Jin and Meiling will leave the group to probe Qi mutations near the Ash Forest alone."
"After the coming Ash Forest hornet war, Jin will have graves dug and flowers grown for fallen bees."
"Jin and Meiling will later have a second son, Jinhai."
